Boulders bad.  Giants are frequently among the summoned.  It's best to
find a corner thusly.

    -----
    |@
    |
    |

Dig (by your preferred means into the corner.

     ----
    |@
    |
    |

Place your stoned Ki-Rin or Titan there.

    `----
    |@
    |
    |

Stone 2 Flesh him.

    A----
    |@
    |
    |

Lead the summoned monsters to your altar and kill them on it for
sacrificey freshness.

Some cautions:  Kill the Umber hulks as soon as you can or they will
release your summoner.  Same goes for the Black Dragons or they will
disintegrate your god fodder.  I like to do it in the high 'teen levels. 
It seems to be the way to get lots of big monsters without any more nasty
summoners.

